<!--
  Monochrome adaptive-icon layer: a single-color silhouette of the same page
  glyph as ic_launcher_foreground. Only alpha/shape matters here — the launcher
  (e.g. Android themed icons, or nyx's monochrome mode) replaces the fill via
  tint. The dog-ear fold and text lines are punched out as transparent holes
  (fillType="evenodd") so the glyph reads. Motif stays inside the central safe
  zone of the 108dp canvas.
-->
